Anna: It depends, but usually about two hours, mostly after school.
Sam: And what do you usually do online?
Anna: I chat with my friends and stream music. Sometimes I write a blog post.
Sam: Interesting. Why do you use the Internet so much?
Anna: Mainly to keep in touch with friends who live far away. It makes me feel less lonely.
Sam: That''s a great reason. Do you ever worry about your privacy?
Anna: Yes, I do. I never give out my home address, and I use a strong password for every account.', 'Sam 在做网上习惯调查;Anna 每天约上网两小时,多在放学后;她常和朋友聊天、流播音乐,有时写博客;主要为了和远方朋友保持联系、减少孤独;她也注意隐私,从不透露家庭住址,每个账户都用强密码。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How much time does Anna usually spend online each day?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["About two hours.","About five hours.","Almost no time.","The whole day."]},{"q":"What does Anna usually do online?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Play football and run.","Chat with friends and stream music.","Only do her homework.","Watch TV with her family."]},{"q":"Why does Anna use the Internet so much?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["To keep in touch with faraway friends.","To earn money.","To buy new phones.","To play games all night."]},{"q":"How does staying online make Anna feel?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["More tired.","Less lonely.","More bored.","Angry."]},{"q":"What does Anna do to protect her privacy?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["She shares her password with friends.","She posts her phone number online.","She never gives out her address and uses strong passwords.","She uses the same easy password everywhere."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U3');
When we shop, we no longer need to wait in line or carry cash.
We can get the newest information from large databases in seconds.
We can also download software, documents, and images whenever we need them.
Most of all, it helps people who live far apart feel close to one another.', '互联网让日常生活方便许多;购物时不再需要排队或带现金;几秒内就能从大型数据库获取最新信息;需要时随时能下载软件、文档和图片;最重要的是,它让相隔遥远的人感到亲近。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What has the Internet done to our daily lives?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Made them more dangerous.","Made them more expensive.","Made them slower.","Made them far more convenient."]},{"q":"What do we no longer need to do when shopping?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Wait in line or carry cash.","Choose what we like.","Use a phone at all.","Talk to anyone."]},{"q":"Where can we get the newest information?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["From old paper maps.","From large databases.","From the radio only.","From nowhere online."]},{"q":"According to the passage, what can we download whenever we need?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Only music.","Only games.","Software, documents, and images.","Nothing useful."]},{"q":"What does the passage say the Internet helps people do most of all?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Spend more money.","Forget their friends.","Travel less.","Feel close to faraway people."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required2', 'U3');
Laura: Sure. This one keeps track of every step you take during the day.
Xiao Bo: That sounds good. I imagine it would help me walk more.
Laura: It might. And this second app can even help you make a fitness plan.
Xiao Bo: Great! What about you? What kind of app do you want?
Laura: I''d like one that helps me get discounts when I shop online.
Xiao Bo: I guess you could save a little money with that. Have you found one yet?
Laura: Not yet. But before I download anything, I always read what other users say.', '小波想找一款健身App;Laura 推荐一款能记录每天步数的;小波觉得能帮他多走路;Laura 说第二款还能帮他制定健身计划;小波问 Laura 想要什么;Laura 想要一款购物时能拿折扣的;小波说能省点钱;Laura 还没找到,且下载前总会先看别人的评价。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What kind of app is Xiao Bo looking for?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["One to help him get in shape.","One to help him cook.","One to help him sleep.","One to help him draw."]},{"q":"What does the first app Laura shows do?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It plays music.","It keeps track of the steps he takes.","It sends emails.","It deletes photos."]},{"q":"What can the second app do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Buy clothes for him.","Charge his phone.","Help him make a fitness plan.","Tell jokes."]},{"q":"What kind of app does Laura want?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["One that streams films.","One that writes blogs.","One that adds money to her bank.","One that helps her get discounts."]},{"q":"What does Laura always do before downloading an app?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["She reads what other users say.","She buys the most expensive one.","She asks her teacher first.","She downloads it at once."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U3');
If a site makes you feel uncomfortable, leave it at once and click nothing.
Never give out your home address or phone number to people you don''t know.
Someone could use that information to steal your identity.
And remember, the more polite you are, the less likely you are to be attacked.', '几条简单的上网安全规则:如果某网站让你不舒服,立刻离开、什么也别点;绝不要把家庭住址或电话给不认识的人;有人可能用这些信息盗用你的身份;记住,你越有礼貌,就越不容易被攻击。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What should you do if a site makes you uncomfortable?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Post an angry message.","Leave it at once and click nothing.","Tell all your friends.","Stay and keep reading."]},{"q":"What should you never give out to strangers?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Your favourite colour.","Your school subjects.","Your home address or phone number.","Your hobbies."]},{"q":"Why is sharing such information dangerous?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It makes your phone slow.","It costs money.","It wastes your time.","Someone could use it to steal your identity."]},{"q":"According to the passage, what happens the more polite you are?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The less likely you are to be attacked.","The slower your phone gets.","The more money you spend.","The more friends you lose."]},{"q":"What is the passage mainly about?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["How to buy a new phone.","A few rules for staying safe online.","How to write a long blog.","How to win online games."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required2', 'U3');
Tom: Of course. Let''s download some new software to clean it up.
Mum: Is it safe? I worry about these things.
Tom: Don''t worry. I''m using a website we''re familiar with. Now it asks you to choose a password.
Mum: What kind of password should I choose?
Tom: A strong one, not your name or birthday. Now press this button to start.
Mum: All right. Oh, it says the software has been downloaded already!
Tom: Perfect. Let''s open it. Look, your phone is running much faster now.', '妈妈手机很慢请 Tom 帮忙;Tom 提议下载新软件清理;妈妈担心是否安全;Tom 说用的是熟悉的网站,要她设个密码;妈妈问设什么样的;Tom 说要强密码,别用名字或生日,然后按按钮开始;很快软件就下载好了;打开后手机快了很多。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is the problem with Mum''s phone?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["It is broken.","It is lost.","It is too slow.","It is too loud."]},{"q":"How does Tom plan to fix it?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["By buying a new phone.","By turning it off forever.","By selling it.","By downloading new software."]},{"q":"Why does Tom say the download is safe?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Because he uses a website they are familiar with.","Because it is free.","Because Mum is watching.","Because it is very fast."]},{"q":"What kind of password does Tom tell Mum to choose?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Her own name.","A strong one, not her name or birthday.","Her birthday.","A short and easy one."]},{"q":"What happens after the software has been downloaded?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The phone stops working.","The screen goes dark.","The phone runs much faster.","Nothing changes."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U3');
It is easy to spend too much time checking messages and photos.
Try to turn off your apps for an hour before you go to bed.
This will help you sleep better and feel calmer the next day.
Remember, you control the Internet; the Internet should not control you.', '给使用社交媒体的人一个小贴士:很容易花太多时间查看消息和照片;试着睡前一小时关掉应用;这能帮你睡得更好、第二天更平静;记住,是你控制互联网,而不该是互联网控制你。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Who is this tip for?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only teachers.","Only small children.","Only shop owners.","Anyone who uses social media."]},{"q":"What is easy to do, according to the passage?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Spend too much time checking messages and photos.","Forget your password.","Lose your phone.","Make new friends."]},{"q":"What does the speaker suggest doing before bed?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Reading more messages.","Turning off your apps for an hour.","Buying a new app.","Posting more photos."]},{"q":"What will doing this help you do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Spend more money.","Stay up later.","Sleep better and feel calmer.","Make more posts."]},{"q":"What is the main message of the passage?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Social media is always bad.","You should never use your phone.","Photos are more important than sleep.","You should control the Internet, not let it control you."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required2', 'U3');

